=Analyze this Job Description and produce scenario-specific competency weights.

JOB DESCRIPTION:
Title: {{ $('Prepare Data').first().json.selected_jd.title }}
Requirements: {{ $('Prepare Data').first().json.selected_jd.core_requirements.join(', ') }}
Description: {{ $('Prepare Data').first().json.selected_jd.full_description }}

Generate weights for these 3 business scenarios:
1. supply_chain_crisis — Prioritize resilience, rapid execution, risk management, crisis response
2. transformation — Prioritize innovation, digital agility, risk-taking, rapid execution
3. automotive_continuity — Prioritize process focus, stability, stakeholder management, operational excellence

For EACH scenario, assign a decimal weight (0.0 to 1.0) to EACH of the 6 dimensions: riskTaking, processFocus, resilience, innovation, stakeholderManagement, executionSpeed. All 6 weights in each scenario MUST sum to exactly 1.0.

